FORMAT: 1A

# 会话代理配置 API

会话代理配置管理 API，用于管理会话中的工具启用状态和 MCP 服务器配置。

# Group 会话代理配置

会话代理配置相关资源。

## 命令执行 [/session_agent_config/command]

执行各种会话代理配置命令的统一入口点。

### 执行命令 [POST]

执行指定的命令，发生异常时自动执行回滚操作。

使用分布式锁确保同一会话的命令不会并发执行。

+ Request (application/json)

所有命令请求的通用结构：

        {
            "command_name": "命令名称",
            "session_id": "会话ID，用于隔离不同会话的命令执行",
            "params": {
                // 命令特定参数
            }
        }

+ Parameters
    + command_name (string, required) - 命令名称
    + session_id (string, required) - 会话 ID，用于隔离不同会话的命令执行
    + params (object, optional) - 命令特定参数，默认为空对象

#### get_tools_enabled_status - 获取工具启用状态

获取会话中指定工具或所有工具的启用状态。

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "command_name": "get_tools_enabled_status",
            "session_id": "session-123",
            "params": {
                "tool_names": ["ask_user_choice", "todo_write"]
            }
        }

+ Parameters
    + tool_names (array[string], optional) - 要查询的工具名称列表，为空表示获取所有工具。可用值: `ask_user_choice`, `todo_write`, `read_file`, `edit_file`, `write_file`, `list_directory`, `move_item`, `copy_item`, `delete_item`, `bash`, `load_skill`, `skill_advisor`

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "data": {
                "tools_status": [
                    {
                        "tool_name": "ask_user_choice",
                        "enabled": true
                    },
                    {
                        "tool_name": "todo_write",
                        "enabled": true
                    }
                ],
                "success": true,
                "message": null
            },
            "error_message": null,
            "command_name": "get_tools_enabled_status",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

#### update_tools_enabled_status - 更新工具启用状态

更新会话中工具的启用状态。

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "command_name": "update_tools_enabled_status",
            "session_id": "session-123",
            "params": {
                "tools_status": [
                    {
                        "tool_name": "ask_user_choice",
                        "enabled": true
                    },
                    {
                        "tool_name": "todo_write",
                        "enabled": false
                    }
                ]
            }
        }

+ Parameters
    + tools_status (array[object], required) - 要更新的工具状态列表
        + tool_name (string) - 工具名称，可用值: `ask_user_choice`, `todo_write`, `read_file`, `edit_file`, `write_file`, `list_directory`, `move_item`, `copy_item`, `delete_item`, `bash`, `load_skill`, `skill_advisor`
        + enabled (boolean) - 工具是否启用

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "data": {
                "updated_tools": [
                    {
                        "tool_name": "ask_user_choice",
                        "enabled": true
                    },
                    {
                        "tool_name": "todo_write",
                        "enabled": false
                    }
                ],
                "success": true,
                "message": null
            },
            "error_message": null,
            "command_name": "update_tools_enabled_status",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

#### get_mcp_servers_config - 获取 MCP 服务器配置

获取会话的 MCP 服务器配置。

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "command_name": "get_mcp_servers_config",
            "session_id": "session-123",
            "params": {}
        }

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "data": {
                "servers": [
                    {
                        "url": "http://localhost:8000/mcp",
                        "name": "default",
                        "timeout": 30.0,
                        "tool_filter": {
                            "allow_list": null,
                            "deny_list": []
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "success": true,
                "message": null
            },
            "error_message": null,
            "command_name": "get_mcp_servers_config",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

#### update_mcp_servers_config - 更新 MCP 服务器配置

更新会话的 MCP 服务器配置。

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "command_name": "update_mcp_servers_config",
            "session_id": "session-123",
            "params": {
                "servers": [
                    {
                        "url": "http://localhost:8000/mcp",
                        "name": "default",
                        "timeout": 30.0,
                        "tool_filter": {
                            "allow_list": null,
                            "deny_list": []
                        }
                    }
                ]
            }
        }

+ Parameters
    + servers (array[object], required) - MCP 服务器配置列表
        + url (string) - MCP Server 的 streamable HTTP URL
        + name (string, optional) - Server 名称，用于日志和错误信息，默认: `default`
        + timeout (number, optional) - 连接和调用超时时间（秒），默认: `30.0`
        + tool_filter (object, optional) - 工具过滤配置
            + allow_list (array[string], optional) - 允许的工具名称列表（白名单），为空则允许所有工具
            + deny_list (array[string], optional) - 禁止的工具名称列表（黑名单）

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        {
            "success": true,
            "data": {
                "servers": [
                    {
                        "url": "http://localhost:8000/mcp",
                        "name": "default",
                        "timeout": 30.0,
                        "tool_filter": {
                            "allow_list": null,
                            "deny_list": []
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "success": true,
                "message": null
            },
            "error_message": null,
            "command_name": "update_mcp_servers_config",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

#### test_mcp_connection - 测试 MCP 服务器连接

测试会话配置的 MCP 服务器连接状态。

+ Request (application/json)

        {
            "command_name": "test_mcp_connection",
            "session_id": "session-123",
            "params": {
                "mode": "all"
            }
        }

+ Parameters
    + mode (string, optional) - 测试模式: `all` 测试所有服务器, `single` 测试单个服务器。默认: `all`
    + server_name (string, optional) - 要测试的服务器名称，仅在 `mode=single` 时有效

+ Response 200 (application/json) - 成功示例

        {
            "success": true,
            "data": {
                "results": [
                    {
                        "server_name": "default",
                        "server_url": "http://localhost:8000/mcp",
                        "status": "success",
                        "server_info": {
                            "name": "MCP Server",
                            "protocol_version": "2024-11-05"
                        },
                        "tools": [
                            {
                                "name": "get_weather",
                                "description": "Get weather information",
                                "input_schema": {"type": "object", "properties": {"city": {"type": "string"}}}
                            }
                        ],
                        "tool_count": 1,
                        "error_message": null,
                        "error_type": null,
                        "response_time_ms": 125.34,
                        "tested_at": "2024-01-15T10:30:00"
                    }
                ],
                "total_servers": 1,
                "success_count": 1,
                "failed_count": 0,
                "success": true,
                "message": "Tested 1 server(s): 1 success, 0 failed"
            },
            "error_message": null,
            "command_name": "test_mcp_connection",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

+ Response 200 (application/json) - 连接失败示例

        {
            "success": true,
            "data": {
                "results": [
                    {
                        "server_name": "default",
                        "server_url": "http://localhost:8000/mcp",
                        "status": "failed",
                        "server_info": null,
                        "tools": [],
                        "tool_count": 0,
                        "error_message": "Connection refused",
                        "error_type": "ConnectionError",
                        "response_time_ms": 5.23,
                        "tested_at": "2024-01-15T10:30:00"
                    }
                ],
                "total_servers": 1,
                "success_count": 0,
                "failed_count": 1,
                "success": true,
                "message": "Tested 1 server(s): 0 success, 1 failed"
            },
            "error_message": null,
            "command_name": "test_mcp_connection",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }

#### 通用错误响应

+ Response 404 (application/json)

        {
            "detail": "Command unknown_command not found"
        }

+ Response 400 (application/json)

        {
            "success": false,
            "data": null,
            "error_message": "Input validation failed: ...",
            "command_name": "command_name",
            "rollback_performed": false
        }